Ghostfog was once the Titan of the Dutch sailor Captain Bernard Fokke, who went down in history as the Flying Dutchman. Ghostfog's presence inspired many ancient tales about pirates and sailors who claim to have seen a ghost ship sailing across the open sea enveloped in a luminous, ghostly fog. He was left to reside on the Flying Dutchman, the legendary haunted ship. {{source|Huntik Magazine}}

Ghostfog's [[Amulet]] was found on the [[Flying Dutchman]] when [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] searched for it. Upon bonding with the [[Titan]], Lok used Ghostfog to destroy [[Diaz]] and [[Snake]]'s boat, whose team were also intent on recovering it. {{Source|The Secret of the Flying Dutchman}}

Diaz and his [[Organization]] team later returned, determined to recapture Ghostfog's Amulet. After taking [[Cherit]] hostage, they forced [[Dante Vale ]] into handing over the Amulet but it was then recovered by Cherit. {{Source|The Bulls of Pamplona}}
